  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Birthday_Bouquet?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/23/Birthday_Bouquet.png/revision/latest?cb=20240411145536\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Birthday Bouquet\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Product</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 92</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f0/Coins.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160223180814\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 1 to 349</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>time</span><span title=\"Production/Building time\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"time\"><img alt=\"time\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/35/Clock.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160228103426\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>  20 min</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 42</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Source </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>Flower Shop</span><span title=\"Flower shop\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/flower-shop-28398\" title=\"Flower Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Flower Shop\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">+</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Default: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 97</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Also: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 2</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/masteries-6459\" title=\"Masteries\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">★★★</a> </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">17 min</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Birthday bouquets</b> are <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">products</a> unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 92. It's not used to make any other product.\n</p><p>It is introduced in <a href=\"/wiki/version-history-34971\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Version History\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">28 June 2021 Update</a>.\n</p><p>Like all <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">products</a>, it is stored in the <a href=\"/wiki/barn-2652\" title=\"Barn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">barn</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Making birthday bouquets</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\"> \t<a href=\"/wiki/flower-shop-28398\" title=\"Flower Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Flower Shop\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a> \t<a href=\"/wiki/flower-shop-28398\" title=\"Flower Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Flower Shop\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/a6/Flower_Shop.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20250925204453\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"thumbimage\" loading=\"lazy\"></a> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AFlower_Shop.png\" class=\"info-icon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>Birthday bouquets are made in <a href=\"/wiki/flower-shop-28398\" title=\"Flower Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Flower Shop</a>.\n</p><p>To make birthday bouquets, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n</p>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><figure class=\"thumb\"> \t<a href=\"/wiki/cherry-juice-2142\" title=\"Cherry Juice\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Cherry Juice\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a> \t<a href=\"/wiki/cherry-juice-2142\" title=\"Cherry Juice\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Cherry Juice\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/ab/Cherry_Juice.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/75?cb=20240223064636\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"thumbimage\" loading=\"lazy\"></a> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Cherry Juice</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n</td>\n<td><figure class=\"thumb\"> \t<a href=\"/wiki/peony-28400\" title=\"Peony\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Peony\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a> \t<a href=\"/wiki/peony-28400\" title=\"Peony\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Peony\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/50/Peony.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/75?cb=20240219030430\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"thumbimage\" loading=\"lazy\"></a> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Peony</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n</td>\n<td><figure class=\"thumb\"> \t<a href=\"/wiki/lily-33000\" title=\"Lily\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lily\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"81\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a> \t<a href=\"/wiki/lily-33000\" title=\"Lily\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lily\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/0a/Lily.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/75?cb=20240219025449\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"81\" class=\"thumbimage\" loading=\"lazy\"></a> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Lily</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n</td>\n<td><figure class=\"thumb\"> \t<a href=\"/wiki/indigo-2083\" title=\"Indigo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Indigo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a> \t<a href=\"/wiki/indigo-2083\" title=\"Indigo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Indigo\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/4/48/Indigo.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/75?cb=20191023151432\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"thumbimage\" loading=\"lazy\"></a> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Indigo</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>×1</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>×3</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>×1</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>×1</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>It takes 20 minutes to make one bouquet, and 17 minutes in a fully <a href=\"/wiki/masteries-6459\" title=\"Masteries\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">mastered</a> flower shop. Each bouquet gives players 42 <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> points.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Selling birthday bouquets</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\"> \t<a href=\"/wiki/roadside-shop-2677\" title=\"Roadside Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Roadside Shop\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a> \t<a href=\"/wiki/roadside-shop-2677\" title=\"Roadside Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Roadside Shop\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/09/Roadside_Shop.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20191028143054\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"thumbimage\" loading=\"lazy\"></a> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ARoadside_Shop.png\" class=\"info-icon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<ul><li>Birthday bouquets can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 3,492 <span>Coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Coin\"><img alt=\"Coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> for 10 bouquets.</li>\n<li>Buying the ingredients required to make 1 bouquet costs 370 <span>Coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Coin\"><img alt=\"Coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>.</li></ul>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Boat orders</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\"> \t<a href=\"/wiki/boat-2675\" title=\"Boat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Riverboat\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a> \t<a href=\"/wiki/boat-2675\" title=\"Boat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Riverboat\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/2c/Riverboat.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20150712182459\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"thumbimage\" loading=\"lazy\"></a> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/media/File%3ARiverboat.png\" class=\"info-icon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/boat-2675\" title=\"Boat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Boat</a> orders ask for 1 to 2 birthday bouquets per crate, up to a total of 8 per boat.</li></ul>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Strategy tips</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Birthday bouquets are one of the few products in the game where the ingredients cost more that the final product.  This means that you are losing coins by producing them. If you cannot find then for sale in the Daily Dirt then only make enough to satisfy your town visitors.  Never sell them in your Roadside Shop.</li></ul>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-flower-shop-products-28468\" title=\"Category:Flower Shop Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Flower Shop Products</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/birthday-bouquet-34955\" title=\"Birthday Bouquet\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Birthday Bouquet\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/bright-bouquet-28464\" title=\"Bright Bouquet\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Bright Bouquet\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/candy-bouquet-29356\" title=\"Candy Bouquet\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Candy Bouquet\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/gracious-bouquet-32998\" title=\"Gracious Bouquet\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Gracious Bouquet\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/rustic-bouquet-28467\" title=\"Rustic Bouquet\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Rustic Bouquet\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/soft-bouquet-28459\" title=\"Soft Bouquet\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Soft Bouquet\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/veggie-bouquet-34692\" title=\"Veggie Bouquet\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Veggie Bouquet\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Products</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260829134715\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.084 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.105 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 895/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 6460/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1150/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 7/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\nLua time u